<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Calpine cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Calpine Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 20-3/8.</p>
